<title>USA: Saudi cuts May Arab Medium to US buyers by 15 cts.</title>
<headline>Saudi cuts May Arab Medium to US buyers by 15 cts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Saudi Aramco cut the crude formula price for May sales of Arab Medium to U.S. buyers by 15 cents, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The new formula is West Texas Intermediate/Cushing minus $4.65 a barrel.</p>
<p>May Arab Heavy was also cut by 15 cents to WTI less $5.50 a barrel.</p>
<p>May extra light Berri was cut by 25 cents to WTI less $2.60 a barrel.</p>
<p>All prices are free on board (fob) Ras Tanura.</p>
<p>((--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk +1 212 859 1620))</p>
